## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical cache invalidation strategies combining Redis and Memcached, emphasizing low-latency invalidation and stampede avoidance.

## Key Concepts
- Redis keyspace notifications
- Pub/Sub fan-out for invalidations
- Cache stampede prevention (debounce, read-through)
- Multivalued keys: product:ID, category:ID, search_index

## Code Example
```javascript
const redis = require('redis');
const client = redis.createClient();

function updateProduct(id, data){
  // update DB... 
  client.del(`product:${id}`);
  client.publish('cache_invalidate', `product:${id}`);
}
```

